<title>HONG KONG: Lung Kee shrholders approve unit spin off.</title>
<headline>Lung Kee shrholders approve unit spin off.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Lung Kee (Bermuda) Holdings Ltd approved the company's plan to seek a separate listing for its metal unit in Singapore by way of a share offer, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
